rver (ahujasid's or the official Blender Lab one). Batch mode produces many consistent assets unattended. Kiln Studio (`/kiln studio`) opens the project's models in the browser, where the user reviews them and pins notes for Claude to act on.\"\nallowed-tools: Bash, Read, Edit, Write, Grep, Glob, WebFetch, WebSearch, mcp__blender__*, mcp__nano-banana__*, mcp__plugin_blender-kiln_kiln-studio__get_selection, mcp__plugin_blender-kiln_kiln-studio__get_notes, mcp__plugin_blender-kiln_kiln-studio__reply_to_note, mcp__plugin_blender-kiln_kiln-studio__set_camera, mcp__plugin_blender-kiln_kiln-studio__get_view_image, mcp__plugin_blender-kiln_kiln-studio__list_models, mcp__plugin_blender-kiln_kiln-studio__add_note, mcp__plugin_blender-kiln_kiln-studio__make_variations, mcp__plugin_blender-kiln_kiln-studio__add_finishes, mcp__plugin_blender-kiln_kiln-studio__open_model, mcp__plugin_blender-kiln_kiln-studio__set_view, mcp__plugin_blender-kiln_kiln-studio__compare, mcp__plugin_blender-kiln_kiln-studio__play_clip, mcp__plugin_blender-kiln_kiln-studio__present", "declared_name": "kiln", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
